                        "entry_id": "0e11afe0-761f-3ed4-b273-d163eef38fb7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Affected, smug, and supercilious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6c2357a-4bc7-472d-bbfa-b698d7a3d807",
                                "sense_id": "5d240d64-0fce-3fe4-a871-a40119020a5c",
                                "text": "Why, look at him—look at this simpering self-righteous mug!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66e9cc70-1947-47dc-b21d-bdbb04157c08",
                                "sense_id": "5d240d64-0fce-3fe4-a871-a40119020a5c",
                                "text": "I know they are supposed to be amusing, and you should be tolerant, but I wanted to swing on one, any one, anything to shatter that superior, simpering composure."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc1a0595-cfa4-4230-a3f9-771c8303a8c9",
                                "sense_id": "5d240d64-0fce-3fe4-a871-a40119020a5c",
                                "text": "I had high hopes when I moved to Spyglass, but simpering gossip on celebrity parties seems to be the closest I've gotten so far to Dad's vocation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5e76152-2f41-408d-8833-6c0b22aa0512",
                                "sense_id": "5d240d64-0fce-3fe4-a871-a40119020a5c",
                                "text": "That sounds almost simpering. I hate sounding simpering, and over a trifling increase of four coppers on a gold, I definitely do not wish to sound simpering."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
